{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0008", "block": 8, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 176, "sha256": "2a249e0f3fb0d139", "text": "[Issues](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/new?template=v2-feedback.yml) are the most useful feedback right now — we'll reopen PRs as v2 stabilizes."}
