{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0013", "block": 13, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 181, "sha256": "6e0d2b5ddef0494d", "text": "The Model Context Protocol (MCP) allows applications to provide context for LLMs in a standardized way, separating the concerns of providing context from the actual LLM interaction."}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0014", "block": 14, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 142, "sha256": "bc6fc8f1bc3ddf89", "text": "This repository contains the TypeScript SDK implementation of the MCP specification. It runs on **Node.js**, **Bun**, and **Deno**, and ships:"}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0015-i00", "block": 15, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 88, "sha256": "578f9cfa7d861423", "text": "MCP **server** libraries (tools/resources/prompts, Streamable HTTP, stdio, auth helpers)"}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0015-i01", "block": 15, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 72, "sha256": "688027ad7f743adf", "text": "MCP **client** libraries (transports, high-level helpers, OAuth helpers)"}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0015-i02", "block": 15, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 104, "sha256": "abd08b38d36f7d0e", "text": "Optional **middleware packages** for specific runtimes/frameworks (Express, Fastify, Hono, Node.js HTTP)"}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0015-i03", "block": 15, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 118, "sha256": "e9e07719ea2a1f95", "text": "Runnable **examples** (under [`examples/`](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/tree/main/examples))"}
