{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0021", "block": 21, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 236, "sha256": "65ea977c452ebb7e", "text": "The SDK also publishes small \"middleware\" packages under [`packages/middleware/`](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/tree/main/packages/middleware) that help you **wire MCP into a specific runtime or web framework**."}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0022", "block": 22, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 233, "sha256": "0eef7c9a7c7188ef", "text": "They are intentionally thin adapters: they should not introduce new MCP functionality or business logic. See [`packages/middleware/README.md`](/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/blob/main/packages/middleware/README.md) for details."}
