{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0043", "block": 43, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 42, "sha256": "7205ea53641fa319", "text": "To work on the documentation site locally:"}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0044", "block": 44, "kind": "code", "translate": false, "chars": 297, "sha256": "8b9c23b980b9ba11", "text": "pnpm docs:api      # Generate the API reference markdown (output: docs/api/)\npnpm docs:dev      # Start the VitePress dev server for the V2 site\npnpm docs:build    # Build the V2 site (output: docs/.vitepress/dist/)\npnpm docs:multi    # Build the combined V1 + V2 site (output: tmp/docs-combined/)"}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0045", "block": 45, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 219, "sha256": "a54140a30f2ce8b0", "text": "The `docs:multi` script builds the V2 site from the current checkout, checks out the `v1.x` branch via a git worktree to build the V1 site, and produces a combined site with V1 docs at the root and V2 docs under `/v2/`."}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0046", "block": 46, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 35, "sha256": "2d9c2c5a31355aa1", "text": "v1 (legacy) documentation and fixes"}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0047", "block": 47, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 405, "sha256": "44b5cc82166f6b49", "text": "If you are using the **v1** generation of the SDK, the **v1 API documentation** is available at [`https://ts.sdk.modelcontextprotocol.io/`](https://ts.sdk.modelcontextprotocol.io/). The v1 source code and any v1-specific fixes live on the long-lived [`v1.x` branch](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/tree/v1.x). V2 API docs are at [`/v2/`](https://ts.sdk.modelcontextprotocol.io/v2/)."}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0048", "block": 48, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 12, "sha256": "2b18598c711f43c2", "text": "Contributing"}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0049", "block": 49, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 163, "sha256": "849ea9889a5e2d12", "text": "Issues and pull requests are welcome on GitHub at [https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk)."}
{"slug": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main", "id": "github-com-modelcontextprotocol-typescript-sdk-tree-main#b0050", "block": 50, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 7, "sha256": "c011d6097bfbc8e9", "text": "License"}
